                    {
                        "form_id": "a3a1fb20-8430-4366-9b5e-aed7768201f4",
                        "entry_id": "ca8e7aa9-0f3e-3c41-894b-5e8ed8668cb6",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "nappiest"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d4905e9b-8680-36e8-94c9-380d647106e1",
                        "entry_id": "ca8e7aa9-0f3e-3c41-894b-5e8ed8668cb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having a nap (of cloth etc.); downy; shaggy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ca56270-981a-4770-aa96-6a8c6232e888",
                                "sense_id": "d4905e9b-8680-36e8-94c9-380d647106e1",
                                "text": "1950, US District Courts, US Court of Claims, US Court of Customs and Patent Appeals, Federal Supplement, Volume 89, page 438,\nThe original accused device, as was the patented device, was made of cotton flannel with a nappy surface on each side, […] ."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c2ec4bcc-fd48-3ef2-b874-3189dfe66d0b",
                        "entry_id": "ca8e7aa9-0f3e-3c41-894b-5e8ed8668cb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of hair: tightly curled or twisted; frizzy (often specifically in reference to Afro textured hair)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "US",
                            "informal",
                            "offensive",
                            "sometimes"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "58b6e282-70e2-4ef9-82e7-213bfa1ccaef",
                                "sense_id": "c2ec4bcc-fd48-3ef2-b874-3189dfe66d0b",
                                "text": "They could scarcely bear their knowledge, nor could they have borne the sight of Rufus, but they knew why he was in the streets tonight, why he rode subways all night long, why his stomach growled, why his hair was nappy, his armpits funky, his pants and shoes too thin, and why he did not dare to stop and take a leak."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4dfcb35-d3b7-4742-8473-287e60a65dcd",
                                "sense_id": "c2ec4bcc-fd48-3ef2-b874-3189dfe66d0b",
                                "text": "We would talk about each other′s ugly, big lips and flat noses. We would call each other pickaninnies and nappy-haired so-and-so′s."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92d29a62-af21-41a9-9ffe-5083eebcd709",
                                "sense_id": "c2ec4bcc-fd48-3ef2-b874-3189dfe66d0b",
                                "text": "For example, some Black people′s corporeal zones include nappy hair texture, wide noses, thick lips, and darker-than-white skin complexion, all of which come into play when an individual is interacting with a cultural “Other.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbe42b4b-d295-4223-adb3-20707a0bcbdc",
                                "sense_id": "c2ec4bcc-fd48-3ef2-b874-3189dfe66d0b",
                                "text": "She had decided to just cover her hair with a scarf because Aunt Bell was “old school” and Zollar did not want to have to explain why she had nappy hair."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "35976302-4375-3d50-a994-864a0e047280",
                        "entry_id": "ca8e7aa9-0f3e-3c41-894b-5e8ed8668cb6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Inclined to sleep; sleepy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "13603df4-fa91-4fca-a0ce-84d711d96efc",
                                "sense_id": "35976302-4375-3d50-a994-864a0e047280",
                                "text": "After supper I felt nappy and dropped right off to sleep."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
